+> STOP. Captain's notes: non-binding. Captain writes, Captain trims. Anyone else: close this file now.
+
+# Captain Notes
+
+Binding behaviour lives in `.feature` specs and referenced `assets/**`. History lives in git. These notes carry only what the next cycle needs.
+
+## Voyage 1 Intent
+
+Build a vanilla-JavaScript TodoMVC app per the TodoMVC spec at `assets/app-spec.md`. Use the base markup from `assets/app-template.index.html`. No preprocessors. Persist to localStorage under the key `todos-vanillajs`.
+
+## Key Decisions
+
+- **localStorage key**: `todos-vanillajs` per spec guidance.
+- **Routing**: hash-based (`#/`, `#/active`, `#/completed`) using `window.addEventListener('hashchange', ...)`. No external routing library required for this scope.
+- **IDs**: `Date.now()` is sufficient for unique IDs in a single-user local app. No UUID library needed.
+- **Step definitions**: will use happy-dom to render the app markup into a DOM for step definitions, so scenarios exercise real DOM events against real markup.
+
+## Specs Written
+
+10 feature files covering: creating, completing, toggle-all, editing, deleting, clear-completed, counter, visibility, routing, persistence.
+
+## Blockers
+
+None.
