--- /dev/null
+++ b/features/clear-completed.feature
@@ -0,0 +1,19 @@
+Feature: Clear completed
+  As a user
+  I want to remove all completed todos at once
+  So that my list only shows active tasks
+
+  Background:
+    Given the TodoMVC app is loaded
+
+  Scenario: Clear completed removes all completed todos
+    Given the user has added a completed todo "Buy groceries"
+    And the user has added a todo "Walk the dog"
+    When the user clicks the Clear completed button
+    Then the todo list does not contain "Buy groceries"
+    And the todo list contains "Walk the dog"
+    And the todo count shows 1 item left
+
+  Scenario: Clear completed is hidden when no todos are completed
+    Given the user has added a todo "Buy groceries"
+    Then the Clear completed button is hidden
