+++ b/features/counter.feature
@@ -0,0 +1,30 @@
+Feature: Active todo counter
+  As a user
+  I want to see how many todos remain
+  So that I know my progress
+
+  Background:
+    Given the TodoMVC app is loaded
+
+  Scenario: Counter shows zero with no todos
+    Then the todo count shows 0 items left
+
+  Scenario: Counter shows singular for one item
+    Given the user has added a todo "Buy groceries"
+    Then the todo count shows 1 item left
+
+  Scenario: Counter shows plural for multiple items
+    Given the user has added a todo "Buy groceries"
+    And the user has added a todo "Walk the dog"
+    Then the todo count shows 2 items left
+
+  Scenario: Counter decrements when a todo is completed
+    Given the user has added a todo "Buy groceries"
+    And the user has added a todo "Walk the dog"
+    When the user clicks the checkbox on "Buy groceries"
+    Then the todo count shows 1 item left
+
+  Scenario: Counter increments when a completed todo is unchecked
+    Given the user has added a completed todo "Buy groceries"
+    When the user clicks the checkbox on "Buy groceries"
+    Then the todo count shows 1 item left
diff --git a/features/creating-todos.feature b/features/creating-todos.feature
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..8616bb6
--- /dev/null
+++ b/features/creating-todos.feature
@@ -0,0 +1,32 @@
+Feature: Creating todos
+  As a user
+  I want to add new todos
+  So that I can track tasks I need to complete
+
+  Background:
+    Given the TodoMVC app is loaded
+
+  Scenario: A new todo is added when pressing Enter
+    When the user types "Buy groceries" in the new todo input and presses Enter
+    Then the todo list contains "Buy groceries"
+    And the new todo input is empty
+    And the todo count shows 1 item left
+
+  Scenario: Empty input is ignored
+    When the user presses Enter with an empty input
+    Then the todo list is empty
+
+  Scenario: Whitespace-only input is ignored
+    When the user types "   " in the new todo input and presses Enter
+    Then the todo list is empty
+
+  Scenario: Multiple todos can be added
+    When the user types "Buy groceries" in the new todo input and presses Enter
+    And the user types "Walk the dog" in the new todo input and presses Enter
+    Then the todo list contains "Buy groceries"
+    And the todo list contains "Walk the dog"
+    And the todo count shows 2 items left
+
+  Scenario: Input is trimmed before creating a todo
+    When the user types "  Buy groceries  " in the new todo input and presses Enter
+    Then the todo list contains "Buy groceries"
